;; `flint.cli`'s own workspace (`DECISIONS.md#four-units`): the command surface
;; both CLIs share, in its own source root rather than the standard library's.
;;
;; Shipped ONLY with the native and npm CLIs. The ESM SDK does not carry it: an
;; embedder compiling programs has no use for `flint tasks`.
;;
;; `.cljc`, NOT `.fln`: the JVM Clojure driver (`bin/flint`) loads `flint.cli`
;; as Clojure (`bin/check` asserts it).
;;
;; NO GRANT. Read 2026-10-08: `flint.cli` requires `clojure.string` and
;; `flint.deps` and nothing else, and names no `flint.rt` builtin outside the
;; text of a program it GENERATES (`task`'s wrapper, which is compiled as that
;; program's own namespace, not this one). It held `flint/flint`'s `[:host]`
;; only because it lived under `lib/`.
{:flint/workspace flint/cli}
